    "question": "Should I build my API with REST or GraphQL, and when does each approach actually make sense?",
    "summary": "REST and GraphQL are two dominant API architectural approaches with distinct trade-offs: REST excels in simplicity, HTTP caching, and public API conventions, while GraphQL shines when multiple clients need flexible, aggregated data with minimal round trips. Choosing between them depends on client…",
